From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] whoami, where: more switches (3522)

whoami, where: more switches

whoami gets /groups, /priv, /all, /fo table|list|csv, /nh, /upn and /fqdn (the last two refuse a local
account as Windows does) and an error for unknown options. where gets /R dir, /Q, /F, /T, the $env:pattern
form, usage text, the INFO message for no match, and exit code 2 for bad syntax.
